  "idea": "Calibre: the ultimate free eBook manager and format converter",
  "text": "The free open-source software that organizes and cleans your digital library. Your research papers, manuals, and eBooks end up scattered across messy downloads folders with missing covers. File explorers cannot fetch metadata or ISBN numbers, turning reference searches into pure friction. Calibre indexes your library, downloads high-resolution covers, and pushes organized files to your device over Wi-Fi. You build a permanent digital bookshelf that never breaks.",
